hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"149","Salih bin Abdul-Rahman bin Amr bin Al-Harith Al-Masry and Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Abdul-Rahim Al-Barqi told us, they said: Tell us Ibn Abi Maryam, Yahya bin Ayyub informed us, Abu Al Hadd, who is Yazid bin Abdullah, informed us, on the authority of Muhammad bin Ibrahim, On the authority of Issa bin Talha, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, on the authority of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, he said: “If one of you wakes up from his sleep and performs ablution, Let him blow his nose three times, for Satan spends the night on his nostrils.”"
